      {
        title: "People cannot find the right starting point",
        description:
          "Navigation follows the organization chart while customer goals, eligibility, urgency, and the next useful action remain hard to recognize.",
      },
      {
        title: "The content explains but does not help",
        description:
          "Information may be accurate, but requirements, choices, timing, proof, exceptions, and the path to completion are scattered across pages.",
      },
      {
        title: "A form creates more manual work",
        description:
          "The submission becomes an email or incomplete record that someone must interpret, correct, route, and enter again.",
      },
      {
        title: "Customers restart when the channel changes",
        description:
          "Identity, history, documents, and prior decisions do not follow people from web to phone, chat, location, sales, or service.",
      },
      {
        title: "Accessibility is checked too late",
        description:
          "Language, structure, forms, focus, errors, media, motion, and assistive technology are reviewed after the experience is already difficult to change.",
      },
      {
        title: "The dashboard says success while service demand rises",
        description:
          "Traffic and submissions improve, but repeat contact, rework, abandonment, unresolved needs, and customer effort remain out of view.",
      },
    ],
  },
