        description:
          "Components create visual consistency while content, workflow states, error recovery, accessibility, and channel decisions remain inconsistent.",
      },
      {
        title: "Old content moves into a new platform",
        description:
          "Pages are migrated without deciding what is necessary, accurate, owned, findable, duplicated, or connected to a customer task.",
      },
      {
        title: "The form improves but the queue does not",
        description:
          "Submission gets easier while missing context, duplicate entry, manual review, unclear routing, and slow follow-up continue behind it.",
